[Debug] ----- Vuln Cause Analysis -----
The potential vulnerability is related to a Directory Traversal vulnerability. This vulnerability arises because the application accepts user input for the directory path without proper validation or sanitization, allowing an attacker to manipulate the input to access files outside the intended directory. By using relative paths or special characters, such as "../", an attacker could potentially traverse the directory structure and gain unauthorized access to sensitive files or directories on the server. This lack of input validation can lead to exposure of confidential data or system files, compromising the security of the application and the underlying system.

